{"id":4062,"date":"2026-03-11T06:37:00","date_gmt":"2026-03-11T01:07:00","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/drdilipdentalcentre.com\/?p=4062"},"modified":"2026-03-12T21:04:22","modified_gmt":"2026-03-12T15:34:22","slug":"tmj-specialists-in-delhi","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/drdilipdentalcentre.com\/tmj-specialists-in-delhi\/","title":{"rendered":"Best TMJ Specialists in Delhi for TMJ\u00a0Disorder Treatment"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><em>Namaste Delhi! If you are looking for the best TMJ in Delhi, then Dr. Dhivya Dilipkumar is the right choice for you. She is India\u2019s top certified TMJ specialist with 15+ years of Industry experience. Call her at <a href=\"tel:+919884520520\">9884 520 520<\/a> and book an online consultation right away.<\/em><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">TMJ (Temporomandibular Joint) disorder is one of those issues that can severely impact your health and quality of life. It causes immense pain and discomfort in the jaw, which leads to difficulty in chewing or any jaw movements and sometimes even headaches.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">In the populated capital city of Delhi, where people are always on the run and stress levels are at the maximum, you do not want to add an extra layer of jaw worries on top of it(especially when Delhi is home to some of the best foods in the country). And so, you can easily find some of the best TMJ specialists to help you with their expertise, care, and innovative approach to treatment.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Before we dive into the best TMJ specialists in Delhi, let\u2019s understand more about TMJ.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">What are TMJ disorders?<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">TMJ disorders are a range of disorders that affect your jaw. This can range from jaw joints to the muscles responsible for jaw movement. The TMJ is the mandible (lower jaw) and the skull (temporal bone). Problems occurring around this can lead to pain, discomfort, and functional issues in your jaw.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Some of the common symptoms of a TMJ disorder include:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Pain or tenderness in your jaw<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Pain around your ear<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Chewing difficulty or discomfort<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Aching facial pain<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Difficulty in opening or closing your mouth due to locking of joint<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Why do TMJ disorders occur?<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">It is difficult to outright say a cause for TMJ disorder as it can vary from person to person, and the effect can vary vastly. Some of the common reasons include:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Physical injury to the jaw or the joint<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Arthritis<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Displacement or dislocation of the joint disc<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Grinding of teeth<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Genetics<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Structural jaw issues at the time of birth<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">How to Choose the Right TMJ Specialist?<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Well begun is half done, and hence choosing the right TMJ specialist is the first critical step towards an effective TMJ treatment. Here are a few things to keep in mind while choosing the right TMJ specialist in Delhi:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Firstly, verify their qualification and experience. To begin with, look for specialists with advanced training in dentistry with specialization in TMJ-related fields. Even check their years of experience in handling TMJ cases and if they are up to date with the latest developments in the field.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Check their reputation and reviews through websites, Google My Business, or patient testimonials. This will give you an idea about their approach, their effectiveness, and their trustworthiness.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Since TMJ