hivya DIlipkumar is one of the best TMJ specialists that the people of Delhi can opt for. This is due to her immense experience as a specialist and her patient-centric approach, which makes her the top choice.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>What are the common symptoms of TMJ disorders?<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Common symptoms include jaw pain or tenderness, difficulty in chewing, a clicking or locking jaw, and sometimes aching pain around the ear. Understanding these symptoms can help in early diagnosis and treatment.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>How do I know if I need to see a TMJ specialist?<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">If you&#8217;re experiencing persistent pain or discomfort in your jaw, difficulty in moving your jaw, or any of the common symptoms associated with TMJ disorders, it&#8217;s advisable to consult a TMJ specialist for a thorough evaluation.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>What treatment options are available for TMJ disorders?<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Treatment options range from conservative methods like physical therapy and oral appliances to more advanced treatments such as injections or surgery, depending on the severity and cause of the disorder.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Can TMJ disorders be cured or only managed?<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The approach to TMJ disorders can vary from curative to management, depending on the underlying cause. Some conditions may require long-term management strategies, while others might be resolved through specific treatments.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-3e41869c wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-luminous-vivid-orange-background-color has-backgroun